  "description": "Chart 2 of 2 on book p. 281 (PR.S(RD)II-35). STY (style) is the subject, with the (R) prefix, \"the reality of\"; PROG-CONT (progressional continuance) is the partner. From the subject: TR (transformation), C-CONT (composite continuance) and TR-INFO (trans-information). From TR: SG (source initiation). From C-CONT: PER-PHY-U-FUND (perceived physical universe fundamental) and RE-DOC (redocumentation). From TR-INFO: APP-RDEF (applied redefinitions). From SG: STF (source transfer). From APP-RDEF: CULT-AF-B (culture affinity basis). From CULT-AF-B: AF-TD (affinity tendencies) and AF-DY (affinity dynamics). From AF-DY: PART (participation).",
